# Routing & Maps Rules

Routing system must:
- Detect road obstacles
- Recalculate routes dynamically
- Avoid dangerous zones
- Prioritize shortest SAFE route
- Support live rerouting
- Handle GPS inaccuracies
- Handle lost signal scenarios

Never:
- Keep stale routes
- Ignore route incidents
- Use static path calculations

Implement:
- Route recalculation engine
- Traffic-aware logic
- Incident-aware rerouting
- Fallback GPS handling
